{
  "format": "manosaba.story",
  "version": 1,
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "path": "Act01_Chapter05/Act01_Chapter05_Trial10",
  "events": [
    {"op": "GosubResetWitchBook", "line": 1, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "System/System_ResetWitchBook", "Version": 2}},
    {"op": "SetCustomVariable", "line": 2, "indent": 0, "params": {"Expression": "isReenact = true"}},
    {"op": "ModifyTextPrinter", "line": 3, "indent": 0, "params": {"Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Normal.Simple", "MakeDefault": 1, "HideOther": 1}},
    {"op": "Gosub", "line": 4, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "System/System_Subroutine.BeginAdv"}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 11, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#000000", "Duration": 1.2000000476837158, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "Transparent", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 12, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.8"}},
    {"op": "PlayBgm", "line": 15, "indent": 0, "params": {"BgmPath": "Bgm_19_1", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 1, "FadeInDuration": 0.0}},
    {"op": "label", "name": "Judge5-10-1", "line": 17, "indent": 0},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 21, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch01_E05_S01", "Wait": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 22, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 26, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "那是……一个漫长的故事……<br>\n而这只是其中的，眨眼一瞬……", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 28, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……我该哪里开始讲起好呢。<br>\n嗯……先说亚里沙小姐吧。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 30, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……亚里沙小姐之前确实在寻死，<br>\n这是真的。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 32, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "当时亚里沙小姐似乎认为还来得及，<br>\n只要过量服用安眠药，就能死去。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 34, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "但是，那时她已经开始魔女化了，<br>\n已经太晚了。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 36, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "所以我给了她杀死魔女的药……特雷德基姆。<br>\n我把它装进安眠药的瓶子里，伪装成安眠药交给了她。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 38, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "亚里沙小姐最后……<br>\n对我说了声【谢谢】……", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru007"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 40, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "之后……我什么都没做。<br>\n因为她是自行了断的。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 42, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "然后是奈叶香小姐……我本来也没打算杀她。<br>\n但是……她看到了不该看的东西，所以……", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru009"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 44, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 45, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch01_E05_S01", "Wait": 0, "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 46, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 50, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch01_E05_S02", "Wait": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 51, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 53, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "今天早上，我进入地下时，发现操作室的控制面板坏掉了。<br>\n我不知道为什么它会摔在地上……<br>\n但当时，我用魔法修复了它。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru010"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 55, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我的魔法拥有非常强大的力量，<br>\n可以像时光倒流一样修复任何东西。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru011"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 57, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "因为控制面板的损坏，<br>\n我想可能有人侵入了地下。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru012"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 59, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "所以我巡视了冷冻室……<br>\n确认有没有异常。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru013"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 61, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……就在那时，<br>\n奈叶香小姐进入了操作室。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru014"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 63, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 64, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch01_E05_S02", "Wait": 0, "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 65, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 72, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch01_E05_S03", "Wait": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 73, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 75, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "奈叶香小姐用枪破坏了通风口的盖子，钻了进去。<br>\n大概是因为打不开门，于是想强行闯入冷冻室吧。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru015"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 77, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我想这时幻视魔法还没有发动，<br>\n因为奈叶香小姐好像没法自由使用它……", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru016"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 79, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 80, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch01_E05_S03", "Wait": 0, "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 81, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 85, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch01_E05_S04", "Wait": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 86, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 88, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "在奈叶香小姐移动的时候，<br>\n我解除了门锁，进入了操作室。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru017"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 90, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "然后，我发现奈叶香小姐一直随身携带的枪<br>\n放在了地上。<br>\n大概是因为带枪钻不进通风口吧。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru018"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 92, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……毕竟枪是危险物品，<br>\n为了以防万一，我把它捡了起来——", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru019"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 94, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 95, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch01_E05_S04", "Wait": 0, "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 96, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 100, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch01_E05_S05", "Wait": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 101, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 103, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "奈叶香小姐在冷冻室里调查时，<br>\n有一段时间看上去很迷茫的样子……", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru020"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 105, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "忽然间，她似乎是想到了什么，<br>\n开始记笔记。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru021"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 107, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "之后她就打开了保险箱。<br>\n我猜那时幻视魔法已经发动了，<br>\n她肯定是看到了密码。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru022"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 109, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "那时，恐怕她已经用幻视，看到了有关我的一切……<br>\n以及监牢的所有秘密。<br>\n……至少，我是这么认为的。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru023"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 111, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "所以……我别无选择，只能杀了她。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru024"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 113, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 114, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch01_E05_S05", "Wait": 0, "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 115, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 120, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch01_E05_S06", "Wait": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 121, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 123, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我从背后接近<br>\n正在查看保险箱里资料的奈叶香小姐……<br>\n开枪杀死了她。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru025"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 125, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "就算中了一枪，奈叶香小姐却还顽强地活着……<br>\n接着我又开了一枪，但奈叶香小姐躲开了。<br>\n她真是个执念很深的人呢。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru026"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 127, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我记得，因为她没有马上断气……<br>\n我们在那里稍微聊了一会。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru027"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 129, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "现在回想起来，她大概就是在拖延时间，<br>\n好留下死亡讯息而已。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru028"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 131, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 132, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch01_E05_S06", "Wait": 0, "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 133, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 137, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch01_E05_S07", "Wait": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 138, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 140, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "过了一会，奈叶香小姐再也不动了，<br>\n我就开始处理尸体。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru029"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 142, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "毕竟控制面板有人为破坏的痕迹，证明有人来过……<br>\n如果再有其他人来，事情就会败露了。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru030"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 144, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "所以，我想把她藏到处刑台装置那边。<br>\n那里应该是没人能进去的。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru031"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 146, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我用斧头把奈叶香小姐的身体切成小块，<br>\n然后一点一点地从小窗塞了进去。<br>\n还好那个小窗够大，勉强塞得进人头。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru032"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 148, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 149, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch01_E05_S07", "Wait": 0, "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 150, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 154, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch01_E05_S08", "Wait": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 155, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 157, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "最后，为了隔墙拼合她的身体，<br>\n我使用了魔法。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru033"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 159, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我的魔法可以完全治愈大的伤口，<br>\n只要不是离身体太远，几乎所有的血液都会回到体内。<br>\n……就像时间倒流一样。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru034"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 161, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "但是，我无法让死人复活……<br>\n而且只能治愈手掌覆盖的有限范围，<br>\n这是我的限制。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru035"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 163, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这次因为我没注意到口腔内的伤，<br>\n结果在那里留下了痕迹。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru036"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 165, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……如果不是奈叶香小姐的执念，<br>\n我想我本可以更好地隐藏这一切吧。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru037"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 167, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这就是事件的全貌。<br>\n一直保持沉默……真的非常抱歉。", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0105Trial10_Meruru038"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 169, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 170, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch01_E05_S08", "Wait": 0, "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 171, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.5"}},
    {"op": "SetCustomVariable", "line": 173, "indent": 0, "params": {"Expression": "isReenact = false"}},
    {"op": "Gosub", "line": 174, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv"}},
    {"op": "GotoModified", "line": 176, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Act01_Chapter05/Act01_Chapter05_Adv06", "SoftReset": 1}}
  ],
  "translations": {
  "0105Trial10_Meruru001": "那是……一个漫长的故事……<br>\n而这只是其中的，眨眼一瞬……",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru002": "……我该哪里开始讲起好呢。<br>\n嗯……先说亚里沙小姐吧。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru003": "……亚里沙小姐之前确实在寻死，<br>\n这是真的。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru004": "当时亚里沙小姐似乎认为还来得及，<br>\n只要过量服用安眠药，就能死去。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru005": "但是，那时她已经开始魔女化了，<br>\n已经太晚了。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru006": "所以我给了她杀死魔女的药……特雷德基姆。<br>\n我把它装进安眠药的瓶子里，伪装成安眠药交给了她。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru007": "亚里沙小姐最后……<br>\n对我说了声【谢谢】……",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru008": "之后……我什么都没做。<br>\n因为她是自行了断的。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru009": "然后是奈叶香小姐……我本来也没打算杀她。<br>\n但是……她看到了不该看的东西，所以……",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru010": "今天早上，我进入地下时，发现操作室的控制面板坏掉了。<br>\n我不知道为什么它会摔在地上……<br>\n但当时，我用魔法修复了它。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru011": "我的魔法拥有非常强大的力量，<br>\n可以像时光倒流一样修复任何东西。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru012": "因为控制面板的损坏，<br>\n我想可能有人侵入了地下。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru013": "所以我巡视了冷冻室……<br>\n确认有没有异常。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru014": "……就在那时，<br>\n奈叶香小姐进入了操作室。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru015": "奈叶香小姐用枪破坏了通风口的盖子，钻了进去。<br>\n大概是因为打不开门，于是想强行闯入冷冻室吧。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru016": "我想这时幻视魔法还没有发动，<br>\n因为奈叶香小姐好像没法自由使用它……",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru017": "在奈叶香小姐移动的时候，<br>\n我解除了门锁，进入了操作室。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru018": "然后，我发现奈叶香小姐一直随身携带的枪<br>\n放在了地上。<br>\n大概是因为带枪钻不进通风口吧。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru019": "……毕竟枪是危险物品，<br>\n为了以防万一，我把它捡了起来——",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru020": "奈叶香小姐在冷冻室里调查时，<br>\n有一段时间看上去很迷茫的样子……",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru021": "忽然间，她似乎是想到了什么，<br>\n开始记笔记。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru022": "之后她就打开了保险箱。<br>\n我猜那时幻视魔法已经发动了，<br>\n她肯定是看到了密码。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru023": "那时，恐怕她已经用幻视，看到了有关我的一切……<br>\n以及监牢的所有秘密。<br>\n……至少，我是这么认为的。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru024": "所以……我别无选择，只能杀了她。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru025": "我从背后接近<br>\n正在查看保险箱里资料的奈叶香小姐……<br>\n开枪杀死了她。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru026": "就算中了一枪，奈叶香小姐却还顽强地活着……<br>\n接着我又开了一枪，但奈叶香小姐躲开了。<br>\n她真是个执念很深的人呢。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru027": "我记得，因为她没有马上断气……<br>\n我们在那里稍微聊了一会。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru028": "现在回想起来，她大概就是在拖延时间，<br>\n好留下死亡讯息而已。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru029": "过了一会，奈叶香小姐再也不动了，<br>\n我就开始处理尸体。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru030": "毕竟控制面板有人为破坏的痕迹，证明有人来过……<br>\n如果再有其他人来，事情就会败露了。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru031": "所以，我想把她藏到处刑台装置那边。<br>\n那里应该是没人能进去的。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru032": "我用斧头把奈叶香小姐的身体切成小块，<br>\n然后一点一点地从小窗塞了进去。<br>\n还好那个小窗够大，勉强塞得进人头。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru033": "最后，为了隔墙拼合她的身体，<br>\n我使用了魔法。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru034": "我的魔法可以完全治愈大的伤口，<br>\n只要不是离身体太远，几乎所有的血液都会回到体内。<br>\n……就像时间倒流一样。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru035": "但是，我无法让死人复活……<br>\n而且只能治愈手掌覆盖的有限范围，<br>\n这是我的限制。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru036": "这次因为我没注意到口腔内的伤，<br>\n结果在那里留下了痕迹。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru037": "……如果不是奈叶香小姐的执念，<br>\n我想我本可以更好地隐藏这一切吧。",
  "0105Trial10_Meruru038": "这就是事件的全貌。<br>\n一直保持沉默……真的非常抱歉。"
}
}
